1. Introduction
The introduction presents an overview to assist the reader in understanding how this Software Requirements Specification (SRS) is organized and how to use it. This document covers all functional and non-functional requirements for the E-Commerce Website with FAQs Chatbot Integration developed at The Islamia University of Bahawalpur, Department of Information Technology.

1.1 Purpose
This Software Requirements Specification (SRS) document provides a detailed description of the requirements for the E-Commerce Website with FAQs Chatbot Integration. The purpose of this document is to clearly define the system's functionalities, constraints, and overall behavior so that developers, supervisors, and stakeholders can understand and implement the system effectively. It also serves as a reference for system design, development, and testing phases. This document is intended for the development team, project supervisor Mr. Suleman Javed, and academic evaluators at The Islamia University of Bahawalpur.

1.2 Scope
The software product to be developed is the E-Commerce Website with FAQs Chatbot Integration, which is a web-based application. The system will allow users to register, log in, browse available products, add items to a shopping cart, and place orders. It will also provide an integrated FAQs chatbot that assists users by answering commonly asked questions. The system will not include advanced artificial intelligence features for chatbot processing and will not support full online payment gateway integration in the initial version.

The application is intended to provide a simple, efficient, and user-friendly platform for online shopping. It aims to improve user experience by combining traditional e-commerce functionalities with automated customer support through a chatbot. The system will help users perform shopping activities and reduce dependency on manual assistance. The major features of the system include:
•	User registration, login, and account management
•	Product browsing, search, and detailed product view
•	Shopping cart management and order placement
•	Integrated FAQs chatbot for automated customer support
•	Administrator panel for product management and order monitoring
•	Secure data storage using MongoDB database

