2. The Overall Description
2.1 Product Perspective
The E-Commerce Website with FAQs Chatbot Integration is a standalone web application developed using client-server architecture. It is an entirely new product, not an extension of an existing system, designed to address the need for a simple, accessible online shopping platform with built-in automated customer assistance. The system interacts with a MongoDB database to store and manage data such as users, products, orders, cart information, and chatbot responses.

The system is similar in concept to existing e-commerce platforms but is distinguished by its additional FAQs chatbot feature that allows users to receive instant, automated answers to common shopping-related questions without requiring human intervention. The portal operates as a three-tier web application: a client browser layer, a Node.js/Express.js application server layer, and a MongoDB database layer. It can be extended in the future to support advanced features such as AI-powered chatbot integration and full payment gateway support.

2.1.1 Operations
•	The system operates in an online environment where users interact through a web browser.
•	Users can browse products, manage their cart, and place orders at any time of the day.
•	The chatbot operates continuously to respond to user FAQ queries without human involvement.
•	The administrator operates the system through a dedicated dashboard to manage products and monitor orders.
•	The system supports continuous operation with periodic database backup and recovery processes.

2.1.2 Site Adaptation Requirements
The system requires installation of a web server environment (such as a Node.js runtime with Express.js) and a properly configured MongoDB database for data storage and management. The system must be deployed in an environment that supports modern web browsers such as Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, or Microsoft Edge to ensure proper user interaction and rendering of all interface components. No special hardware is required for system operation; however, proper configuration of software components, including the database and Node.js server environment, is necessary for smooth and efficient functioning of the system.

2.2 Product Functions
The system provides the following major functions to its users and administrators:
•	User Registration and Login: Users can create accounts and securely log in to access personalized shopping features.
•	Product Browsing and Viewing Details: Users can browse all available products, apply filters, and view detailed descriptions, prices, and images for each product.
•	Shopping Cart Management: Users can add products to a shopping cart, update quantities, and remove items as needed.
•	Order Placement: Users can review their cart and place orders, which are recorded in the database for processing.
•	FAQs Chatbot Interaction: Users can type queries into the chatbot interface and receive automated responses matched from a database of predefined FAQ answers.
•	Admin Product Management: Administrators can add, update, and delete products from the catalog through a management dashboard.
•	Admin Order Monitoring: Administrators can view all placed orders, track their status, and manage the order lifecycle.
•	Admin Login: Administrators have a separate, secure login path to access the admin panel.

